        "reference_answer": "Separate Student(student_id, student_name, dept_id), Department(dept_id, dept_name), Course(course_id, course_title), and Enrollment(student_id, course_id, grade). Identify partial dependencies on student_id and course_id and the transitive department dependency. Enrollment represents the many-to-many association. Key-based joins reconstruct enrollment facts without spurious tuples and each specified dependency is enforced in a relation.",
